<report>
<line><title>Proportion meta-analysis</title></line>
<line></line>
<line>Method: <in>methodLabel</in></line>
<line></line>
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>Responding</th><th>Total</u><block name="inputs"></td></tr>
<tr><td><in>st</in></td><td><in>r</in></td><td><in>n</in></td><td><subtotal><in>lb</in></subtotal></block></td></tr>
</table>
<line></line>
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>Proportion</th><th><ci><in>pc</in>% CI (exact)</ci></u><block name="proportions"></td></tr>
<tr><td><in>st</in></td><td><in>p</in></td><td><ci><in>from_y</in></td><td><in>to_y</in></td><td></ci><subtotal><in>lb</in></subtotal></block></td></tr>
</table>
<line></line>
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>Standardized effect</th><th>Variance</th><th>% Weights (fixed, random)</u><block name="proportions"></td></tr>
<tr><td><in>st</in></td><td><in>yi</in></td><td><in>vi</in></td><td><in>wt</in></td><td><in>dwt</in></td><td><subtotal><in>lb</in></subtotal></block></td></tr>
</table>
<line></line>
<line><u>Fixed effects (inverse variance)</u></line>
<line>Pooled proportion = <in>rmh</in> (<ci><in>pc</in>% CI = <in>from</in> to <in>to</in></ci>)</line>
<line></line>
<line><u>Non-combinability of studies</u></line>
<line>Cochran Q = <in>qc</in>  (df = <in>df</in>)  <pval><in>xp</in></pval></line>
<line>Moment-based estimate of between studies variance = <in>tausq</in></line>
<line>I&#xb2; (inconsistency) = <in>isq</in>% (<ci><in>pc1</in>% CI = <in>llisq</in>% to <in>ulisq</in>%</ci>) </line>
<line></line>
<line><u>Random effects (DerSimonian-Laird)</u></line>
<line>Pooled proportion = <in>dspr</in> (<ci><in>pc</in>% CI = <in>from_ds</in> to <in>to_ds</in></ci>)</line>
<line></line>
<line><u>Bias indicators</u><block name="egger"></line>
<line>Begg-Mazumdar: Kendall's <in>tau</in>  <pval><in>p2</in></pval></line>
<line>Egger: bias = <in>a</in> (<ci><in>pc_egger</in>% CI = <in>cl</in> to <in>cu</in></ci>)  <pval><in>p</in></block><block name="harbord"></pval></line>
<line>Harbord: bias = <in>a</in> (<ci><in>pc_harbord</in>% CI = <in>cl</in> to <in>cu</in></ci>)  <pval><in>p</in></block></pval></line>
<line></line>
<line></line>
</report>
